<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.6725 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.6725 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6725 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6698 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 22		  Nov 21</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.6725		  4.6698</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    700,000		 500,000</p>
